		<item>
		<title>Stainless steel cartridge housing</title>
		<link>https://filter.philitee.com/?product=stainless-steel-cartridge-housing</link>
					<comments>https://filter.philitee.com/?product=stainless-steel-cartridge-housing#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[wpdc@20248]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 01 Dec 2024 14:07:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">http://filter.philitee.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=4183</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[We offer a wide range of housings suitable for smaller process flows where a single filter cartridge is required. This range includes high pressure versions, housings with integral viewing sections and housings with a unique closure to ensure operation is as easy as possible.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>Single Cartridge Housing Product Features:</h2>
<ul>
<li>Quick release Vee Clamp Closure for easy opening</li>
<li>Lightweight, high specification investment cast head</li>
<li>Easy to use tie rod assembly design ensures cartridge centralisation (for a reliable knife edge seal) that enables the use of either 9.75” or 10” cartridge length configurations (or multiples) in the same housing</li>
<li>Dual purpose head accepts SOE code 3 and DOE cartridges</li>
<li>SOE code 7 and code B adaptors available</li>
<li>Available in 316L stainless steel or Alloy 22 for maximum compatibility</li>
<li>Wide range of connection size and types, cartridge lengths and materials of construction</li>
<li>PED Compliant to Sound Engineering Practice</li>
<li>Full traceability on all parts, material certification packs available</li>
<li>Rated at full vacuum and 10 bar g in liquid and gases</li>
<li>Can be supplied with a differential pressure gauge</li>
<li>WRAS approved product</li>
</ul>
<h2>Features and Benefits</h2>
<p>1.Investment Cast head (avoids the porosity &amp; inclusion problems associated with lower quality sand castings)<br />
2.Integral vent and drain sockets to aid efficient filter changeout complete with PTFE washer<br />
3.Unique interchangeable configuration enables choice of SOE or DOE cartridge styles in the same housing<br />
4.Every housing is etched with a serial number for full traceability<br />
5.Full housing customisation service available<br />
6.Available in both 316L Stainless Steel and Alloy 22</p>
<h2>Specification</h2>
<p><strong>Maximum Operating Conditions</strong> Pressure Range: Liquid: FV / 10 bar g Gas: FV / 10 bar g Temperature Range: -10ºC / 150ºC<br />
<strong>Materials of Construction</strong> Body and Closure: 316L St.Steel Alloy 22 Clamp: 304 St.Steel Seal: Ethylene Propylene<br />
<strong>Finish</strong> Vessel: Externally polished sump, bead blast head Connections Inlet/Outlet: 1” BSPF Vent: ¼” BSPF with Plug Drain: ¼” BSPF with Plug</p>
<h2>Multi Cartridge Housing Product Features:</h2>
<ul>
<li>Free standing, easy to install design</li>
<li>Universal cup allows the use of plug in or DOE cartridge styles in the same housing</li>
<li>Vee clamp closures use unique ‘W’ style seal for reliable leak free operation</li>
<li>High quality cast Vee band clamps for safety and security</li>
<li>Cast compression nut with integral PTFE washer for easy, hand tight cartridge sealing</li>
<li>Wide range of connection sizes and types, cartridge lengths and materials of construction</li>
<li>PED and ATEX Compliant</li>
</ul>
<h2>Features and Benefits</h2>
<p>1.Integral vent, clean and dirty drain sockets to aid efficient filter changeout<br />
2.Universal cup enables choice of plug in (Code 3, Code 8 and Code A) or DOE cartridge styles in the same housing<br />
3.Bolted closure options available<br />
4.Every housing is etched with a unique serial number for full traceability<br />
5.Available in 316L Stainless Steel<br />
6.Full housing customisation service available<br />
7.Internally and externally electropolished as standard</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
